        <documentation>TOGAF Strategy / Phase B. The four supporting cross-domain value streams (VS-07 Governance &amp; Compliance, VS-08 Innovation &amp; Methodology, VS-09 Infrastructure &amp; Platforms, VS-10 Customer &amp; Stakeholder Engagement) with their stages, key roles and the principles they foreground (per SAF). They run a continuous plan-build-operate-improve cycle aligned to GAMSO and enable the primary production chain. Capability-to-stream links are inferred (review).</documentation>
      </element>
