        <documentation>TOGAF Phase B - Business Architecture. The statistical data value chain: each primary stream's Execution process consumes one steady state of data and produces the next, signalling the handover with a registration event (loose coupling, SAF-P07). Confidentiality is applied progressively from #2 to #5 (SAF-P11).</documentation>
      </element>
