        <documentation>TOGAF Phase B - Business Architecture. The four-process governance pattern (Design -> Implementation -> Execution -> Management, with improvement feedback) applied to VS-01.0 Data Acquisition and Ingestion / business domain Observation-Collection: roles, business objects, steady states, services, external actors and the capabilities realised. The same pattern applies to VS-02..VS-06.</documentation>
      </element>
